 "notes": [
  "The published title refers to the 11 September 2001 attacks (the post is dated the next day), so this page is titled Nathan Russell DS; the post's description is left blank for the same reason.",
  "A just-for-fun list with no objective or starting section; the author's joke comments after card names are dropped and each row keeps the posted text.",
  "Posted 'Earth', 'Afghanistan Desert Hideout', 'Afghanistan Bin Laden's Toilet', 'Afghanistan Kabul' and 'Dead Afghani X3' are not SWCCG cards; they are printed as written (5 locations, 3 interrupts).",
  "The post lists 60 cards and an edit adds Wipe Them Out, All Of Them as 'the 61st card'; total 61 as published.",
  "Cloud City Blaster, Disruptor Pistol and Death Star: Docking Bay 327 dested to their Dark pages; Dannik Jerriko is the printed A New Hope card, not (V); Any Methods Necessary (posted under Effects) is an Interrupt."
